WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.428
The Earth and the Moon, to scale.

00:03.128 --> 00:09.143
We are far above the north pole, with both worlds at their true sizes and their true distance.

00:09.593 --> 00:15.380
The Moon is the small dot, thirty Earths away, and it takes a month to go once round.

00:15.830 --> 00:18.873
The Sun lights half of each of them, all the time.
